{"id":"840f3a795c44b39b","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-henkin-omitting.md","title":"Henkin's Omitting Types Theorem","display":"Henkin's Omitting Types Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-henkin-omitting","aliases":["93-thm-henkin-omitting"],"display":"Henkin's Omitting Types Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-type]]","[[93-df-nonprincipal-type]]","[[93-df-omitting-types]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-countable-language]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-henkin-omitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-henkin-omitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Henkin's Omitting Types Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03527aba4c537723\" href=\"?note=03527aba4c537723\" title=\"93-df-type\">93-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fd6e0844d0c8dd1\" href=\"?note=1fd6e0844d0c8dd1\" title=\"93-df-nonprincipal-type\">93-df-nonprincipal-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"61a9386f2a01b571\" href=\"?note=61a9386f2a01b571\" title=\"93-df-omitting-types\">93-df-omitting-types</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6402ac591e410d0b\" href=\"?note=6402ac591e410d0b\" title=\"93-df-countable-language\">93-df-countable-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-henkin-omitting-—-Henkin's-Omitting-Types-Theorem\">thm-henkin-omitting — Henkin's Omitting Types Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{CountLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\)</span> are the sourced predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\)</span> is the countable-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}omitting}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CountLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}omitting}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CountLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>For a countable first-order language, a consistent theory has a countable model omitting each specified nonprincipal type.  The conclusion concerns a model; a syntactically complete extension is not itself an object that realizes or omits tuples.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-henkin-omitting-—-Henkin's-Omitting-Types-Theorem","text":"thm-henkin-omitting — Henkin's Omitting Types Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"03527aba4c537723","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-nonprincipal-type","status":"resolved","id":"1fd6e0844d0c8dd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-nonprincipal-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-omitting-types","status":"resolved","id":"61a9386f2a01b571","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-omitting-types]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-countable-language","status":"resolved","id":"6402ac591e410d0b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-countable-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}$ is the countable-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}omitting}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CountLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["03527aba4c537723","1fd6e0844d0c8dd1","61a9386f2a01b571","30a8f872911e731f","6402ac591e410d0b","e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}